flowchart TD
    Start([Deadlock Management Entry]) --> LoadState[/Input Available, Max Matrix, Allocation Matrix/]
    LoadState --> ValidateMatrix{Validate Dimensions & Allocation <= Max}
    ValidateMatrix -- Invalid --> ShowErr[Raise Validation Exception] --> LoadState

    ValidateMatrix -- Valid --> DeriveNeed[Compute Need = Max - Allocation]
    DeriveNeed --> DisplayNeed[/Display Need Matrix/]

    DisplayNeed --> ModeChoice{Select Action}

    ModeChoice -- Check System Safety --> InitWork[Set Work = Available, Finish = all False, Seq = empty]
    InitWork --> SearchProc{Find Pi where Finish is False and Need_i <= Work}

    SearchProc -- Found Pi --> ExecutePi[Work = Work + Allocation_i<br/>Finish_i = True<br/>Append Pi to Seq]
    ExecutePi --> SearchProc

    SearchProc -- None Found --> CheckFinish{Are all Finish True?}
    CheckFinish -- Yes --> SafeResult[State: SAFE<br/>Safe Sequence: Seq]
    CheckFinish -- No --> UnsafeResult[State: UNSAFE / DEADLOCK RISK<br/>Safe Sequence: None]

    ModeChoice -- Evaluate Dynamic Request --> InputReq[/Input Process P_k and Request Vector/]
    InputReq --> CheckNeed{Request <= Need_k?}
    CheckNeed -- No --> ErrExceed[Error: Process exceeded max claim] --> RetMenu
    CheckNeed -- Yes --> CheckAvail{Request <= Available?}
    CheckAvail -- No --> WaitAvail[Process must wait: Resources currently unavailable] --> RetMenu

    CheckAvail -- Yes --> SpeculativeAlloc[Speculative: Available -= Req, Alloc_k += Req, Need_k -= Req]
    SpeculativeAlloc --> RunSafetyCheck[Run Banker's Safety Algorithm]
    RunSafetyCheck --> IsSpecSafe{Is system in Safe State?}

    IsSpecSafe -- Yes --> CommitAlloc[Commit Allocation: Safe state guaranteed] --> SafeResult
    IsSpecSafe -- No --> RollbackAlloc[Rollback State: Request denied to prevent deadlock] --> UnsafeResult

    SafeResult --> DisplayOutcome[/Display Status and Safe Sequence/]
    UnsafeResult --> DisplayOutcome
    DisplayOutcome --> RetMenu([Return])
